## Troubleshooting Checklist

| Issue | Check | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Text still small | Is buildGraphicPrompt fully replaced? | Full copy-paste |
| Too many colors | Are brand guides using old format? | Update storage.ts |
| Still cluttered | Is model Haiku or Sonnet? | Switch to Sonnet |
| Layouts same | Is layoutArchetype passed? | Check server_changes.js |

